{"seq":1,"slug":"hot-sku-deduction","title":"热点 SKU 分桶扣减与合并","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/concurrency-cache/hot-sku-deduction","wordCount":2500,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"热点-sku-分桶扣减与合并\">热点 SKU 分桶扣减与合并</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>大促的流量形状和日常完全不同。日常的库存请求均匀分布在数万个 SKU 上，每个 SKU 每秒几次；大促时个位数的爆款会吸走绝大部分请求，单个 SKU 的扣减请求可能达到每秒十万次。前两章的所有方案在这个量级上都会遇到同一个天花板：<strong>同一个键上的串行化成本</strong>。</p>\n<p>数据库路线下，天花板是 InnoDB 的行锁。单个热点的所有扣减事务在同一行上排队，每个事务需要持有锁、写 undo、提交刷盘。锁的持有时间由最慢的那一步决定，实际测得的单行热点上限通常在每秒数千次量级。Redis 路线下，天花板是单线程命令执行——虽然单命令极快，但单个 key 的 Lua 脚本仍要排队，且整个 Redis 实例的命令流被这一个 key 消耗掉。</p>\n<p>分桶（sharding / bucketing）的思路很直接：既然一个键上最多只能串行 N 次，那就把它拆成 k 个键，让请求分散到 k 个可以并行处理的键上，总吞吐提升到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。代价是引入了三个新问题：桶间不平衡（某些桶先空了、另一些还有货）、跨桶聚合（查总量要汇总 k 个桶）、以及拆分后如何回收到一个总量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>单桶吞吐</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>总分桶吞吐</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>单桶吞吐</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>当请求均匀分布时</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{单桶吞吐} = \\frac{1}{t_{lock} + t_{work}}, \\quad \\text{总分桶吞吐} \\approx k \\cdot \\text{单桶吞吐} \\quad (\\text{当请求均匀分布时})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单桶吞吐</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总分桶吞吐</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单桶吞吐</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当请求均匀分布时</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式的后半句藏着一个陷阱：它只在请求均匀分布到 k 个桶时成立。如果哈希函数或分配策略有偏，实际吞吐会显著低于理论值，而且会先在某些桶上出现「假售罄」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    REQ[&quot;十万次/秒扣减请求&quot;] --&gt; LB{&quot;路由: 选择桶&quot;}&#10;    LB --&gt;|&quot;hash(orderNo) % k&lt;br/&gt;或 随机 k&quot;| B0[&quot;桶 0&lt;br/&gt;stock=1250&quot;]&#10;    LB --&gt; B1[&quot;桶 1&lt;br/&gt;stock=1250&quot;]&#10;    LB --&gt; B2[&quot;桶 2&lt;br/&gt;stock=1250&quot;]&#10;    LB --&gt; Bk[&quot;桶 k-1&lt;br/&gt;stock=1250&quot;]&#10;    B0 --&gt;|&quot;扣减成功&quot;| OK[&quot;下单成功&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; OK&#10;    B2 --&gt;|&quot;桶内已空&quot;| FALL{&quot;跨桶重试&lt;br/&gt;合并剩余&quot;}&#10;    Bk --&gt; FALL&#10;    FALL --&gt;|&quot;其他桶有余量&quot;| OK&#10;    FALL --&gt;|&quot;全部为空&quot;| SOLD[&quot;售罄&quot;]&#10;    B0 --&gt; AGG[&quot;聚合视图&lt;br/&gt;总量 = Σ 桶余量&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; AGG&#10;    B2 --&gt; AGG&#10;    Bk --&gt; AGG\">graph TD\n    REQ[\"十万次/秒扣减请求\"] --&gt; LB{\"路由: 选择桶\"}\n    LB --&gt;|\"hash(orderNo) % k&lt;br/&gt;或 随机 k\"| B0[\"桶 0&lt;br/&gt;stock=1250\"]\n    LB --&gt; B1[\"桶 1&lt;br/&gt;stock=1250\"]\n    LB --&gt; B2[\"桶 2&lt;br/&gt;stock=1250\"]\n    LB --&gt; Bk[\"桶 k-1&lt;br/&gt;stock=1250\"]\n    B0 --&gt;|\"扣减成功\"| OK[\"下单成功\"]\n    B1 --&gt; OK\n    B2 --&gt;|\"桶内已空\"| FALL{\"跨桶重试&lt;br/&gt;合并剩余\"}\n    Bk --&gt; FALL\n    FALL --&gt;|\"其他桶有余量\"| OK\n    FALL --&gt;|\"全部为空\"| SOLD[\"售罄\"]\n    B0 --&gt; AGG[\"聚合视图&lt;br/&gt;总量 = Σ 桶余量\"]\n    B1 --&gt; AGG\n    B2 --&gt; AGG\n    Bk --&gt; AGG</pre><h2 id=\"分桶的两种语义\">分桶的两种语义</h2><p>分桶不是「把库存分成 k 份各自独立卖」，而是有两种语义完全不同的实现，选错会导致总量错误。</p>\n<p><strong>语义一：固定配额（partitioned quota）。</strong> 总库存 5000 件显式分成 10 个桶各 500 件。每个桶独立扣减，桶空了就真的没货，不会去借别的桶。优点是完全无跨桶通信、吞吐线性扩展、实现极简。缺点是<strong>可能出现「部分桶有货但用户买不到」</strong>：如果流量只打到了桶 3 和桶 7，这两个桶卖空后，其余 8 个桶的库存虽然还在，但这两个桶的请求会被拒绝。除非请求量远超库存量（秒杀场景下确实如此），否则这会造成可感知的「提前售罄」。</p>\n<p><strong>语义二：弹性配额（elastic quota）。</strong> 桶上的数字只是「本地缓存的额度」，扣减时若本桶不足，向一个中心池或邻居桶借。优点是不浪费库存。缺点是需要跨桶通信，而跨桶通信本身又回到串行化问题——降级为「本地扣减 + 异步补充额度」的模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function deductWithBucket(skuId: bigint, whId: number, qty: number): Promise&lt;number&gt; {&#10;  for (let attempt = 0; attempt &lt; 3; attempt++) {&#10;    const bucket = pickBucket(skuId, attempt);&#10;    const left = await redis.evalScript(DEDUCT_SCRIPT, [`inv:${skuId}:${whId}:b${bucket}`], [qty]);&#10;    if (left &gt;= 0) return left;&#10;    if (left === -3) continue; // 本桶余额不足，换桶重试&#10;  }&#10;  return -1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deductWithBucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">skuId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">whId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; attempt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pickBucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(skuId, attempt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">evalScript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DEDUCT_SCRIPT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`inv:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">skuId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">whId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:b${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bucket</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], [qty]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 本桶余额不足，换桶重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里 <code>pickBucket</code> 返回的桶上有本地可用额度。第三种语义是「<strong>本地额度 + 中心真相</strong>」：每个应用实例（或每个桶）持有一个本地额度，扣减全在本地完成，额度耗尽时向中心申请下一批。这就是本章下半部分要讲的合并与批量补货。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>跨桶通信</th>\n<th>库存利用率</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定配额</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低（可能提前售罄）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>秒杀（请求量 &gt;&gt; 库存量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹性配额</td>\n<td>有（借还）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大促日常混合流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地额度 + 中心真相</td>\n<td>批量（申请/回收）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>超大规模、实例数多</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"桶数选择与哈希策略\">桶数选择与哈希策略</h2><p>桶数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 不是越大越好。三个约束决定它：</p>\n<p><strong>约束一：桶数不能超过库存量太多。</strong> 库存 10 件分 100 个桶，每个桶 0.1 件——这意味着 99 个桶是空的，只有一个桶有货，分桶完全失效。经验规则是每个桶至少 5–10 件，秒杀场景可放宽到 1–2 件（因为固定配额语义下提前售罄是可接受的）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mtext>总可售量</mtext><mtext>每桶最小件数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\le \\frac{\\text{总可售量}}{\\text{每桶最小件数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每桶最小件数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总可售量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>约束二：桶数受分片数约束。</strong> 在 Redis Cluster 下，桶 key 如果落在同一个分片上，分桶就没有并行效果。必须保证桶 key 的哈希结果分散到不同分片——最简单的做法是让桶 key 的哈希标签（hash tag）不同，即 <code>inv:{sku}:b0</code>、<code>inv:{sku}:b1</code> 而不是 <code>inv:{sku:b0}</code>、<code>inv:{sku:b1}</code>（后者会被 Redisson 之类的 hash tag 规则强制同分片；Redis Cluster 规定，若 key 含 <code>{...}</code> 则只对花括号内子串做 CRC16 取模 16384 得到槽位，来源：Redis Cluster Specification — Hash tags, <a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/reference/cluster-spec/）。\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/reference/cluster-spec/）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>约束三：桶数与合并成本成反比。</strong> 每次查询总量、每次补货、每次对账都要遍历 k 个桶。k = 128 时，一次对账要读 128 个 key，用 <code>MGET</code> 或 Lua 脚本合并可以压到一次往返，但仍然是 128 次读操作。</p>\n<p><strong>哈希策略</strong>决定请求分布的均匀度。三种可选：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>orderNo % k</code> — 请求均匀（订单号近似随机），但同一个订单的重试会落到同一桶，配合幂等键工作良好。</li>\n<li>随机选桶 — 分布最均匀，但重试可能落到不同桶，需要注意幂等键不能只靠桶内记录。</li>\n<li>一致性哈希 + 动态桶数 — 支持运行时扩缩桶数而不全量重分布，代价是复杂度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实践中推荐 <code>orderNo % k</code>（或 <code>hash(orderNo) % k</code>），因为它给了「同一订单总是看同一个桶」这个有用的局部性，且订单号的随机性足以保证分布均匀。<strong>不要用 <code>userId % k</code></strong>：大 V 用户的请求会集中到一个桶，桶间不平衡反而会加剧。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- 分桶扣减脚本&#10;-- KEYS[1] = 桶 key, KEYS[2] = 扣减流水 key（幂等）&#10;-- ARGV[1] = qty, ARGV[2] = orderNo&#10;local exists = redis.call(&#39;HGET&#39;, KEYS[2], ARGV[2])&#10;if exists then return tonumber(exists) end&#10;&#10;local cur = tonumber(redis.call(&#39;HGET&#39;, KEYS[1], &#39;avail&#39;) or &#39;-2&#39;)&#10;if cur == -2 then return -2 end&#10;local qty = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;if cur &lt; qty then return -3 end&#10;&#10;local left = redis.call(&#39;HINCRBY&#39;, KEYS[1], &#39;avail&#39;, -qty)&#10;redis.call(&#39;HINCRBY&#39;, KEYS[1], &#39;used&#39;, qty)&#10;redis.call(&#39;HSET&#39;, KEYS[2], ARGV[2], left)&#10;redis.call(&#39;EXPIRE&#39;, KEYS[2], 86400)&#10;return left\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 分桶扣减脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS[1] = 桶 key, KEYS[2] = 扣减流水 key（幂等）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[1] = qty, ARGV[2] = orderNo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local exists = redis.call('HGET', KEYS[2], ARGV[2])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if exists then return tonumber(exists) end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local cur = tonumber(redis.call('HGET', KEYS[1], 'avail') or '-2')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if cur == -2 then return -2 end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local qty = tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if cur &#x3C; qty then return -3 end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local left = redis.call('HINCRBY', KEYS[1], 'avail', -qty)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('HINCRBY', KEYS[1], 'used', qty)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('HSET', KEYS[2], ARGV[2], left)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('EXPIRE', KEYS[2], 86400)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return left</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个脚本同时解决了幂等与分桶两个问题：<code>KEYS[2]</code> 是「本桶上该订单的扣减结果」记录，重试直接返回原结果；<code>used</code> 字段用于后续对账（见 <a href=\"../concurrency-cache/cache-db-consistency\">Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合并-把-k-个桶收敛成一个总量\">合并：把 k 个桶收敛成一个总量</h2><p>分桶之后，「这个 SKU 还有多少货」这个问题需要遍历所有桶。三种合并方式，成本差异很大。</p>\n<p><strong>方式一：实时聚合。</strong> 每次查询都 <code>MGET</code> 所有桶再求和。只在查询量小的时候可行；热点 SKU 的库存查询本身就是十万级 QPS，实时聚合会把 Redis 再打一遍。</p>\n<p><strong>方式二：异步汇总 + 近似值。</strong> 每个桶在扣减成功后异步更新一个汇总 key（<code>HINCRBY sum:sku:wh avail -qty</code>），查询读汇总 key。汇总值与真实值之间有一个很小的延迟窗口，用于展示与告警足够，用于下单决策不行。</p>\n<p><strong>方式三：定期快照。</strong> 每 N 秒或每当变化量超过阈值时，把各桶的值合并写入数据库与缓存快照。这是最常用的方式，它把合并成本摊到时间维度上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as 应用实例&#10;    participant B as 桶 (k 个)&#10;    participant Agg as 汇总器&#10;    participant DB as 数据库&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;B: 分桶扣减 (高并发, 无跨桶通信)&#10;    B--&gt;&gt;App: 桶内余量&#10;    loop 每 500ms&#10;        Agg-&gt;&gt;B: MGET 所有桶&#10;        B--&gt;&gt;Agg: 各桶 avail/used&#10;        Agg-&gt;&gt;Agg: sum(avail) 与 sum(used)&#10;        Agg-&gt;&gt;DB: 写入聚合快照 + 对账基准&#10;        Agg-&gt;&gt;B: 若某桶低于水位 → 触发补货申请&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as 应用实例\n    participant B as 桶 (k 个)\n    participant Agg as 汇总器\n    participant DB as 数据库\n    App-&gt;&gt;B: 分桶扣减 (高并发, 无跨桶通信)\n    B--&gt;&gt;App: 桶内余量\n    loop 每 500ms\n        Agg-&gt;&gt;B: MGET 所有桶\n        B--&gt;&gt;Agg: 各桶 avail/used\n        Agg-&gt;&gt;Agg: sum(avail) 与 sum(used)\n        Agg-&gt;&gt;DB: 写入聚合快照 + 对账基准\n        Agg-&gt;&gt;B: 若某桶低于水位 → 触发补货申请\n    end</pre><p>汇总器还有第二个职责：<strong>桶间再平衡</strong>。当检测到某些桶余量低于水位、另一些桶仍有大量余量时，可以把一部分额度从富桶迁到穷桶。这个迁移必须是原子的（用 Lua 脚本同时改两个桶），且要防止两个汇总器并发迁移造成超发。简单可靠的做法是给迁移加一个基于外部存储的租约，只有持有租约的汇总器能执行迁移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"降级-桶服务不可用时怎么办\">降级：桶服务不可用时怎么办</h2><p>分桶把单点压力变成了 k 个点，但它引入了新的依赖。当 Redis 或桶服务不可用时，不能简单地把请求全部转到数据库——数据库承受不住，会把整个交易链路打挂。</p>\n<p><strong>降级策略一：本地内存桶。</strong> 每个应用实例在内存中持有一部分额度，Redis 不可用时用本地额度继续扣减，扣完为止。这是最有效的降级，它把「系统完全不可用」变成「只能卖一部分」。代价是额度在实例间无法回收，实例崩溃时它的额度丢失（少卖，安全方向）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class LocalBucketFallback {&#10;  private local: Map&lt;string, number&gt; = new Map();&#10;&#10;  tryLocal(key: string, qty: number): number {&#10;    const cur = this.local.get(key);&#10;    if (cur === undefined) return -2;&#10;    if (cur &lt; qty) return -1;&#10;    this.local.set(key, cur - qty);&#10;    return cur - qty;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  grant(key: string, qty: number): void {&#10;    this.local.set(key, (this.local.get(key) ?? 0) + qty);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LocalBucketFallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> local</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  tryLocal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cur</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.local.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.local.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  grant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.local.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.local.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>降级策略二：超时快速失败。</strong> 给 Redis 调用设置严格的超时（例如 50 毫秒），超时即视为不可用并进入降级。绝不使用默认的无限重试——在 Redis 抖动时，无限重试会把应用线程池耗尽，把「Redis 慢」放大成「全站不可用」。</p>\n<p><strong>降级策略三：只读降级。</strong> 全部扣减失败，展示层只显示「活动火爆，请稍后再试」。这是最后手段，通常用于极端故障。</p>\n<p>降级的三个层次要有明确的切换条件与告警，且<strong>降级期间的对账必须加强</strong>：本地扣减的额度没有经过 Redis，恢复后必须从流水重建（见 <a href=\"../concurrency-cache/cache-db-consistency\">Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分桶把单键串行化成本摊到 k 个键上，吞吐近似线性提升，前提是请求在桶间均匀分布。</li>\n<li>分桶有两种语义：固定配额（无通信、可能提前售罄）与弹性配额（利用率高、有跨桶开销）。秒杀用前者，混合流量用后者。</li>\n<li>桶数由「每桶最小件数」与「库存总量」共同约束，不能超过库存量太多；Redis Cluster 下必须让桶分散到不同分片。</li>\n<li>哈希推荐基于订单号（保证重试局部性与分布均匀），不要用用户 ID（大 V 会导致倾斜）。</li>\n<li>合并有实时聚合、异步汇总、定期快照三种，热点场景必须用后者；汇总器同时负责桶间再平衡，再平衡需要租约防止并发超发。</li>\n<li>降级必须有本地内存桶与严格超时；降级期间的对账强度要提升，因为本地扣减未经 Redis。</li>\n<li>下一步：分桶与缓存的差异如何被发现和修复，见 <a href=\"cache-db-consistency\">Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"热点 SKU 分桶扣减与合并","id":"热点-sku-分桶扣减与合并"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分桶的两种语义","id":"分桶的两种语义"},{"level":2,"text":"桶数选择与哈希策略","id":"桶数选择与哈希策略"},{"level":2,"text":"合并：把 k 个桶收敛成一个总量","id":"合并-把-k-个桶收敛成一个总量"},{"level":2,"text":"降级：桶服务不可用时怎么办","id":"降级-桶服务不可用时怎么办"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"超时未支付库存释放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/deduct-reserve/timeout-release"},"next":{"title":"Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/concurrency-cache/cache-db-consistency"}}